    <string name="oobe_welcome_title">Welcome to SignHelper</string>
    <string name="oobe_welcome_body">When a hooked app reads another app signature through PackageManager, SignHelper replaces it with a forged signature you configured.\n\nIt only patches PackageInfo.signatures, for simple signature checks.</string>
    <string name="oobe_basics_title">Basics</string>
    <string name="oobe_basics_body">1. Enable the module in LSPosed and select the apps to hook\n2. Add target apps in the list (installed app or APK)\n3. Open app info and fill in a forged signature (hex)\n4. Force-stop the hooked app and open it again</string>
